<title>PHILIPPINES: Metro down 4.62 pct at 6.20 pesos.</title>
<headline>Metro down 4.62 pct at 6.20 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metro Pacific Corp shares dropped by 30 centavos, or 4.62 percent, to 6.20 pesos on Thursday as property stocks continued to be battered by a belief the boom in the high-end real estate market was fizzling, brokers said.</p>
